  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leasing in Tuzla</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uthyrning i Tuzla</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xF6;reningen Reningsborg har erh&#xE5;llit &#xF6;verskottsvaror fr&#xE5;n svenska f&#xF6;rsvaret som man vill utnyttja genom att starta upp uthyrningsverksamhet i Tuzla i Bosnien. Lokal part &#xE4;r  krigsinvalidorganisationen RVI 13 Mart. M&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att skapa arbetstillf&#xE4;llen och att etablera detta f&#xF6;retag.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NGO Reningsborg has acqired a lot of equipment from the Swedish Defence Industry and wants to use theese through the implementation of a leasing company in Tuzla, BiH. The local implementing part is the organisation, RVI 13 Mart. The objective is to create work opportunities and to start up a sustainable leasing company.</narrative>
  </description>
